{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/131000-another-new-hollow-merit","id":131000,"title":"Another New Hollow Merit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-10T17:03:42-07:00","id":131000,"title":"Another New Hollow Merit","content":"While thinking about mobile hollows, I had this idea. I based cost on Ritual Door.<br /> <br /> Mysterious Storefront (\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> Pre-Requisite: Hollow (Size) 1+, Hollow (Door) 5, at least 1 dot of either Archive, Workshop, or Goblin Merchant<br /> Effect: one of the doors to your hollow becomes more variable. The door can be made to relocate to a new position once per the lowest Wyrd of your hollow\u2019s owners per cycle of the moon (ie per 28 days). The exterior of this door manifests as some sort of shop relevant to your hollow\u2019s workshop or archive, or to the merchandise you sell as a Goblin Merchant. You only have limited control of where the door will next appear, roll Wyrd (of any one hollow owner that is in the hollow at the time f relocation) + occult (of same character), success = you choose the city, freehold, goblin market, etc. where the Mysterious Storefront arrives, Exceptional success allows the character that rolled to specify precisely where in the new city, market, etc., failure leaves the choice up to the ST, dramatic failure and the Mysterious Storefront does not move at all.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if it's detailed enough.<br /> Constructive or possessive comments?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I also post a long form story, based on a Changeling: The Lost campaign at: <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/10018173/1/Great-Fight-A-Twilight-Tommy-Tale\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/s/1001817...ght-Tommy-Tale</a><br /> I hope you will enjoy it.","edited":{"userid":0,"u